; Authored PSX oil lamp: a stepped brass fount on a turned foot, with a faceted
; glass chimney and a wick wheel on the operator's side.
;
; The wick sits at 0.185 m — the fount tops out under it and the chimney begins
; above it — so the flame is the one thing that crosses from brass into glass.
; Everything the desk contract measures (the Flame position, its distance to
; DeskLampLight, the WickInteractable box) is unchanged from the CSG proxy this
; replaced.
